      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# Aku XIV Collect\n\nA Dalamud plugin that exports supported in-game collection progress as JSON for\nthe FFXIV Collect import page: <https://ffxivcollect.com/import>.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Log in on the character you want to export.\n2. Run `/akuxivcollect`.\n3. Click **Scan character**.\n4. Click **Copy JSON**.\n5. Paste the JSON into FFXIV Collect's import page and verify the counts before importing.\n\n## Exported keys\n\nFFXIV Collect currently accepts these import keys, and the plugin emits all of\nthem:\n`armoires`, `bardings`, `cards`, `fashions`, `frames`, `hairstyles`, `leves`,\n`npcs`, `occult_records`, `orchestrions`, `outfits`, `records`, `relics`,\n`spells`, and `survey_records`.\n\nSome categories are direct game unlock checks, while categories where FFXIV\nCollect uses its own IDs are mapped through the public FFXIV Collect API before\nexporting. Always use the import page's verification step before submitting:\nincluding an empty array clears that collection.\n\n## Build\n\n```powershell\ndotnet build .\\AkuXIVCollect.sln -c Release -p:Platform=x64\n```\n\nThe project uses `Dalamud.NET.Sdk/15.0.0`.",
      "title": "AkuXIVCollect",
      "url": "https://github.com/Akurosia/AkuXIVCollect"
    }
  },
